 5. The original non-negotiable engineering principles still apply and are not up for renegotiation: native Swift/AppKit/SwiftUI only, no shelling out for system stats, event-driven APIs over polling wherever possible, the two-tier tile/tab model (collapsed pill vs. on-demand tabs), a single central polling hub, teardown-on-close for every tab, local-first with Keychain-stored secrets, and Apple-quality spring animations throughout. If any correction or addition below seems to conflict with these, flag it rather than silently picking one side.

